# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day28

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| prevalent | 널리 퍼진 | The disease was prevalent in the region. |
| contribute | 기여하다, 원인이 되다 | Several factors contribute to climate change. |
| inhibit | 억제하다, 방해하다 | Lack of sunlight can inhibit plant growth. |

---

## Synonyms

### prevalent
→ widespread / common

### contribute
→ help cause / add to

### inhibit
→ prevent / restrict

---

## Useful Collocations

widely prevalent
→ 널리 퍼진

contribute to
→ ~에 기여하다 / ~의 원인이 되다

inhibit growth
→ 성장을 억제하다

